window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>After nearly two months out away from Pine Lake and the women in his life, Chris is finally ready to head back. Feeling like he's conquered his demons, or at least won a decisive battle against them, and learned some crucial things about himself and his relationships, he's eager to return home and continue his life there.</p> <p>But it's going to be a long walk, and although he isn't too concerned about the day-to-day difficulties of traveling across the frozen wilderness, he's nervous about traveling with the four women he's picked up while out finding himself. Besides the practical difficulties that come with such a journey, he's now discovering a new problem.</p> <p>Hannah, who claims to not have any interest in him whatsoever, is beginning to act strangely around him, and if it leads to where he thinks (and secretly hopes) it's going, then his life is about to get a lot more complicated...</p>"; 
